    {
      "id": "bp-cut-gen-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 447,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 68,
      "text": "for each ω: solve LP, extract πₜ*(ω)\nβ(ω) = Wₜᵀπₜ*(ω)\nα(ω) = Qₜ(x̂,ω) - β(ω)ᵀx̂_{t-1}\nadd cut: θ_{t-1} ≥ ᾱ + β̄ᵀx_{t-1}",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "baseline": 62,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 3010081,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "containerId": "bp-cut-gen-box",
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "bp-aggregation-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 82,
      "text": "single-cut aggregation:\n  β̄ = Σ_ω p(ω) · β(ω)     ᾱ = Σ_ω p(ω) · α(ω)\nadd to stage t-1 problem:\n  θ_{t-1} ≥ ᾱ + β̄ᵀ x_{t-1}\n(one cut per visited state, per stage)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "baseline": 76,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 3010082,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
