    {
      "id": "legend-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 585,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "○  =  stage LP solve (one per stage per scenario)\n→  =  forward simulation (sample ωₜ, solve, advance)\n←  =  backward cut generation (extract duals, add cut)\n◇  =  convergence check (gap test)\n- - →  =  next iteration loop (dashed red, k ← k+1)",
