    {
      "id": "eq-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 75,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "Lower bound:  z̲ᵏ = V₁ᵏ(x₀)                  (monotone ↑, deterministic)\nUpper bound:  z̄ᵏ = (1/M) Σₘ Σₜ cₜᵀxₜᵐ       (statistical estimate)\nGap:  gapᵏ = (z̄ᵏ − z̲ᵏ) / max(1, |z̄ᵏ|) < ε\nStop when:  gapᵏ < ε  or  k > k_max  or  time > t_max",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "baseline": 74,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
